WEBVTT

00:08:59.787 --> 00:09:02.204
I listened to her words,
I suppose they were true.

00:09:02.204 --> 00:09:04.287
I was me,

00:09:04.287 --> 00:09:06.412
but I was now me despite a limp,

00:09:06.412 --> 00:09:09.246
and that, I suppose,
was what now made me, me.

00:09:11.037 --> 00:09:12.537
Anyway, Mohamed told me

00:09:12.579 --> 00:09:15.287
what perhaps he would not
have told another stranger.

00:09:15.329 --> 00:09:18.746
He led me to a house
of cream stucco, then drove off.

00:09:19.371 --> 00:09:22.329
And as I sat contemplating what to say,

00:09:22.371 --> 00:09:25.412
a woman approached
in a black shawl and black robe.

00:09:25.996 --> 00:09:27.912
I stepped from my car and said "Shalom,"

00:09:27.954 --> 00:09:29.871
and identified myself,

00:09:29.912 --> 00:09:31.704
and she told me that her husband Abed